infinite wisdom, boss,

259
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,717
but I'm pretty positive the driver
saw something he shouldn't have seen.

260
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,560
Yes, my apologies, boss.

261
00:15:31,020 --> 00:15:34,020
I've already begun keeping
watch over the building.

262
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:36,554
You think you're watching the building?

263
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:38,560
I'd re-evaluate, Deep.

264
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,100
Look harder, but move slow.

265
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,911
Make no sudden movements.

266
00:15:43,020 --> 00:15:44,785
You must not appear flustered.

267
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:49,800
The one who's being watched
right now is you, Deep.

268
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:51,830
What?

269
00:15:51,913 --> 00:15:52,743
That's Risotto!

270
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:55,417
He's one of the traitors
from the Hitman team!

271
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:58,120
That Ian Dolphin was right! There he is!

272
00:15:58,300 --> 00:16:00,300
He's certainly a crafty one.

273
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:05,117
The plane crash managed to tip him off to
the photo of Sardinia from Trisha's house.

274
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:08,120
Our first order of business
is to take him out.

275
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:11,657
Otherwise, he'll be even more
trouble once Trisha arrives.

276
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:13,657
Just leave the killing blow to me.

277
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:14,622
I'll handle it.

278
00:16:14,940 --> 00:16:19,764
Your job is to close the distance between
us without revealing your true identity.

279
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:23,220
Even I have no insight
into Risotto's abilities.

280
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:26,101
Lure him within two meters of us.

281
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:29,720
I need the fool well within
Emperor Crimson's range.

282
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:31,312
So I'll leave it to you.

283
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,670
Ciao, Doppio.

284
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,780
Atta, mi caro. Right.

285
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:36,700
You can count on me, boss.

286
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:40,840
What's going on here?

287
00:16:41,780 --> 00:16:43,520
My head is killing me!

288
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,493
Oh yeah, that's the least of my worries.

289
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,477
The boss just called with a direct order.

290
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:52,089
I have to keep an eye on the
building, and then I need to...

291
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,510
To...

292
00:16:53,740 --> 00:16:56,040
What did he say? Close the gap?

293
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,800
That's right. Move in closer.

294
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:00,737
Okay, but closer to what?

295
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:02,761
It won't happen, so don't stress.

296
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,760
Over here.

297
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:16,257
What the...

298
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,360
I know I've seen that face before.

299
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,180
But who is he?

300
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,620
Move your hand away.

301
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,500
I want to see your face.

302
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,558
Please, sir, I don't have any money.

303
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:31,560
It's my blood.

304
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:33,420
Oh, man.

305
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:36,131
Why does this always have to happen to me?

306
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:37,599
Guess I was wrong.

307
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,737
This coward doesn't have the
faintest clue what's going on.

308
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:41,650
He's pathetic.

309
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,960
No one from Passione
would behave like this.

310
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:48,857
Besides, he's practically
begging to be attacked.

311
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:51,705
Looks like he's just your
run-of-the-mill brat.

312
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,840
Please, don't!

313
00:17:53,940 --> 00:17:54,860
Give it a rest.

314
00:17:55,060 --> 00:17:56,648
I'm just grabbing my knife.

315
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,940
You're of no interest to me now.

316
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:03,640
I don't feel so good.

317
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,320
My head is aching.

318
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,060
Two meters.

319
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:10,420
That's right.

320
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:15,197
And now that I'm remembering, you did
do something kind of fishy back there.

321
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,820
When you tripped and fell on your face,

322
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,176
you almost reflexively hid
the envelope on the ground.

323
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:23,800
I'm pretty sure I saw you hide it.

324
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:26,800
Under your foot. So what's inside?

325
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,139
If it's nothing, I'll be on my way.

326
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:31,860
What do you want?

327
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:33,920
Look, I told you I'm broke!

328
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,277
Just let me go in peace!

329
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:37,700
I sense no bloodlust or hostility.

330
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:40,660
But still, I know a liar when I see one.

331
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:44,201
Stand up and show me what
you're hiding underfoot.

332
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:48,300
I set up, dammit! Hop-to!

333
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:52,860
Oh, shit.

334
00:18:53,140 --> 00:18:54,493
It is just an envelope.

335
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:57,020
The thing's totally empty.

336
00:18:57,900 --> 00:19:00,488
Guess the groveling
wasn't an act after all.

337
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:03,739
You're just a coward who
can't lie to save his life.

338
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:06,500
That said, everything's changed.

339
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,249
You intrigue me more
and more every second.

340
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:12,420
I have no doubt you're a stand user.

341
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:15,440
You also heard that sound, didn't you?

342
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:19,820
Just now, you made a stealthy
glance towards that whirring noise.

343
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:21,967
Someone's combing the place.

344
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:24,826
They're carrying out a
reconnaissance mission.

345
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:27,040
That could only be one stand!

346
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:28,920
Will Bomber!

347
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:31,920
They finally made it to Sardinia!

348
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:37,020
Well now, you'd have to be very
special to be sent to this location.

349
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:41,055
Clearly the boss has a
tremendous deal of faith in you.

350
00:19:41,340 --> 00:19:44,420
Despite all that, your
fear's 100 % genuine.

351
00:19:44,940 --> 00:19:47,528
You are quite the
fascinating contradiction!

352
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:49,960
Stop talking!

353
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:53,517
The only one who's going to be
quaking with fear is you, Stronezo!

354
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:54,430
Interesting.

355
00:19:54,660 --> 00:19:58,542
Your charging ahead tells me you're
a close-range user with power.

356
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:02,640
Your range is two or three
meters, as long as I know that.

357
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:04,880
Killing you's easy. What?

358
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,040
My throat!

359
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:12,720
What the hell is this?

360
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:14,860
These actual razor blades!

361
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:21,837
I just need to get within two
meters of this edgy douche!

362
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:25,240
Once I do, I'll jam these
blades straight up his ass!

363
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:27,852
Like I said, I know just how to kill you.

364
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:35,800
Damn that hurt, but you're still dead!

365
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:40,640
He's gone?

366
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,540
That must be it.

367
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,348
That's his special ability.

368
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:47,360
But how am I supposed to...

369
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:55,420
I know I heard a phone ringing.

370
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:00,280
That's incredible.

371
00:21:00,660 --> 00:21:04,425
Who would ever guess there'd be
a payphone all the way out here?

372
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:06,850
Hello?

373
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:08,420
My Deep.

374
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:10,316
Where are you, boss?

375
00:21:10,460 --> 00:21:11,290
Are you here?

376
00:21:11,373 --> 00:21:12,203
Are you nearby?

377
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,588
I need your help with this.

378
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,960
No, the time is not yet right.

379
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:20,948
Until you close the gap between
the two of you, I cannot act.

380
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:24,340
If he catches sight of me
and manages to get away,

381
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:27,071
all our efforts will have been for naught.

382
00:21:27,280 --> 00:21:28,157
But boss...

383
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:29,416
You know what to do.

384
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:31,580
Move within two meters of risotto.

385
00:21:32,380 --> 00:21:35,137
Boss, I still have no
idea how his powers work.

386
00:21:35,220 --> 00:21:37,160
He's just gonna get me again.

387
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:38,940
Oh, Deep.

388
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,280
Dear Deep.

389
00:21:41,520 --> 00:21:43,720
My sweet, charming Deep.

390
00:21:44,140 --> 00:21:47,117
Have you so easily
forgotten that I bestowed

391
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,612
you with part of Emperor Crimson's power?

392
00:21:50,560 --> 00:21:53,980
Now's your chance to
apply your unique talents.

393
00:22:05,220 --> 00:22:06,397
Is just fiction.

394
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:08,337
Or what is the truth?

395
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:10,517
They have a mission.

396
00:22:10,600 --> 00:22:12,397
They are a blessing.

397
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:14,877
They dare to tell us.

398
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,677
What's bad and what's good.

399
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:18,137
Stand up!

400
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:20,177
Join us!

401
00:22:20,260 --> 00:22:22,157
Come on!

402
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:23,097
Just say this.

403
00:22:23,180 --> 00:22:26,097
We are the power!

404
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:28,257
Who's in the future?

405
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:31,237
This is we are. The fighters.

406
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:34,320
Just fighting for. The rise.

407
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:41,440
Alright.

408
00:24:08,760 --> 00:24:09,960
Thank you.
